  "id": "control",
  "title": "Maximum Security",
  "theme": "castle",
  "start": "control",
  "intro": "You slipped out of cell 7 and crept into the security control room. It is the middle of the night, the duty guard is asleep in his chair and the monitors hum on the wall. One steel door leads to the yard: a card reader, a code that the warden changes every hour, and a laser grid you cannot see.",
  "winTitle": "Out in the yard",
  "winText": "The reader blinks green, the code is accepted and the heavy door slides open. The lasers are dark. Behind you the guard snores on. Ahead: the yard, the searchlights and the outer wall. Room one: done.",
